  "message": "I can open the Green Account for you, but I first need to verify your identity. Please provide any 2 of these 4 items exactly as they appear on your Rho-Bank profile: date of birth, email address, phone number, or home address. I will not transfer or deposit any money; you can fund the account yourself later.\n\nFor the Silver Rewards Card, the documented process is to complete the online application, consent to the credit check, review the credit-limit offer and terms, and accept them to finalize setup. I’m unable to submit that application directly from this chat, but you can apply through Rho-Bank online banking or the mobile app."
